  "details": "It's easier to identify these leaks, by using the grayscale colorblind filter, and an all yellow custom UI theme.\n\n-HUD pop-ups\n\n-Emojis, Stickers in Inventory tab fluctuates between colorblind and non-colorblind\n\n-Items, and Drone Cosmetics (except for Wing)\n\n-Text entry field: copy/paste\n\n-Expressions Wing\n\n-User Icons\n\n-Notification 'red dots'\n\n-Sort by Filter\n\n-Some elements in Search tab\n\n-Region indicators\n\n-Reporting menu selection bubbles\n\n-Camera+filters",
